"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aFg46WEHr</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aFg46WEHr</guid><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>哥斯拉为何无法被打败？人类成功猎杀哥斯拉后会发生什么？</title><description>《哥斯拉三部曲》二十世纪最后的夏天。那一天，人类终于知道自己并非地球这颗行星唯一的统治者。 巨型生物，以及驱逐怪兽的终极存在哥斯拉出现了。经历与怪兽之间长达半个世纪的战争，人类屡战屡败，最终计划逃出地球。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116961975476196&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/9528504e7afac0f14dedff7b25d90bee881aae25.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bagr6ZEmX</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bagr6ZEmX</guid><pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 11:07:51 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>特效乱飞，满屏版权！但相比这些其中的某个细节才是最打动你的瞬间</title><description>《头号玩家》詹姆斯哈利迪一手建造了名为“绿洲”的虚拟现实游戏世界，临终前，他宣布自己在游戏中设置了一个彩蛋，找到这枚彩蛋的人即可成为绿洲的继承人。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116939427026941&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/35fec645a44d8291b7ada0b6f353ce556d4362be.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1dqKw67Eb5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1dqKw67Eb5</guid><pubDate>Sat, 18 Jul 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>童年噩梦却是定格动画的百年巅峰！听名字小孩都不会看《鬼妈妈》</title><description>《鬼妈妈》小女孩卡洛琳搬进新居后，破旧而又死气沉沉的环境让她感觉无聊透顶。无趣古板的父母，怪异的邻居，还有一个讨厌的小男孩和他的小黑猫，这样的生活对于满脑子都是奇思妙想的她来说，简直要了命。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116915938924244&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8aa1d1424eabca2736d815f78116fe43c117c317.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vFNX6QEx2</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vFNX6QEx2</guid><pubDate>Tue, 14 Jul 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>精神小伙比你想得棒！当老爸给你递来一杯酒时，那就证明你已经告别了青春</title><description>《零食小屋》形影不离的好朋友 AJ 和 Moose 在销售自酿啤酒的计划落空后，决定经营当地泳池的小吃店。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116904781945657&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/133408f55b6f5be88ec7c7f54f23721abb0c9a57.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1WkNM65ERq</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1WkNM65ERq</guid><pubDate>Sun, 12 Jul 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>最胖最呆的"超级英雄"，AI的发展让大白或许真的不远了</title><description>《超能陆战队》未来世界的超级都市旧京山，热爱发明创造的天才少年小宏，在哥哥泰迪的鼓励下参加了罗伯特·卡拉汉教授主持的理工学院机器人专业的入学大赛。他凭借神奇的微型磁力机器人赢得观众、参赛者以及考官的一致好评，谁知突如其来的灾难却将小宏的梦想和人生毁于一旦&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116879230243083&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e49dcb401e82dfa96d37f1b3f1eb7d9a5868202b.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1t6Mh6REfv</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1t6Mh6REfv</guid><pubDate>Fri, 10 Jul 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>岳云鹏都不搞笑了？这部算导的新剧到底有多狠</title><description>《悬案》该剧以2016年3月公安部刑侦局主抓的“疑难命案积案攻坚行动”所侦破的多起案件为基础，改编创作两起90年代悬案&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116872284478841&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8fe2be389a1ebd09b641a0b89469df8caf3a98b4.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1A7TQ6ME29</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1A7TQ6ME29</guid><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>整片被黄色填满，情节简单到爆炸，就这都能拿到近8分的评价？</title><description>《小黄人大眼萌》从地球诞生之初，一种奇怪的生物便出现在这颗蓝色的星球上。他们不断进化、蜕变，终于成为我们所熟悉的小黄人的模样。小黄人们毕生寻找邪恶的老大，以成为他的部属为荣，但是千百万年来的努力最终化成一场空&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116860439762664&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5ba7dabf9210a2283a5392698d9f630e1731e11a.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MsMF6vEAH</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MsMF6vEAH</guid><pubDate>Sat, 04 Jul 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>建议全屏观看！拍电影好像很简单！超级简单的剧情，却能拿到8.5分</title><description>《风的气息》伊朗偏远的小山村，一对残障父子家里突然停电，前来维修的电工目睹了艰难维生的家庭情况，踏上了帮助他们的两天一夜的旅程。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116850222438049&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/fa5c9eefb8ba3e8ed3534698b9b1379864cd06e3.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aHTE6xEb5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aHTE6xEb5</guid><pubDate>Thu, 02 Jul 2026 11:51:56 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>天赋重要还是努力重要？为啥国外的贫民窟那么容易出球星？</title><description>《金球》来自喀麦隆的米拉给非洲人民带来了至高的荣誉，尽管他的家境贫寒，在为家里干农活的同时还要上学，米拉还是决心自己赚钱来买一个真正的足球。幸运的是，他从一名女医生那里得到了一个礼物：一个旧的皮球。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116798045363062&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/bb70c9bd4c0cc8aead41cba04a439f0dd4341a40.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1t5j16EEFD</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1t5j16EEFD</guid><pubDate>Tue, 23 Jun 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>喝点酒教出了一个班的大学生？拔叔的演技巅峰，最后一舞尽显中年男人的魅力</title><description>《酒精计划》四位中学教师的故事。他们决定进行一项实验，每天保持一定的酒精摄入量，以观察其对生活和工作的影响。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116769792596991&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/a1d3174d56aa0caf7e4c47e6b464b875c02e9b98.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1nUjc67EzF</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1nUjc67EzF</guid><pubDate>Thu, 18 Jun 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>真实事件改编，挖煤小伙用炮仗造火箭，最后被航天局录取</title><description>《十月的天空》1957年，苏联卫星发射成功，美国民众萌发了危机意识。一个矿井小镇的普通高中生霍默此刻却为自己的未来忧虑，他在球队选拔中落选，而体魄强健的哥哥一直更受父亲约翰认可，不甘于平庸的霍默萌生了制作火箭的想法&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116758635681993&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/1425406ddec07a8a02394b2b263524f94caafa5e.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1p7ju66E8Y</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1p7ju66E8Y</guid><pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>《玩具总动员》这个系列真的就是一封情书，跨越了31年才邮递给成年的你</title><description>《玩具总动员5》胡迪、巴斯光年、翠斯等“元老级”玩具将跟随小主人邦妮的成长脚步，共同迎接数字时代下的全新挑战。随着无所不能的科技产品逐渐走进童年世界，一批充满科技感的崭新角色也随之重磅亮相&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116746740637077&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/43321bae88e92fbf6ba96fb06165b578a18fa0c6.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jzJF6LEEw</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jzJF6LEEw</guid><pubDate>Sun, 14 Jun 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>看心理医生不如看电影？真正的脑洞大开！终于知道为什么脑子里会有声音了</title><description>《头脑特工队》可爱的小女孩莱莉出生在明尼苏达州一个平凡的家庭中，从小她在父母的呵护下长大，脑海中保存着无数美好甜蜜的回忆。当然这些记忆还与几个莱莉未曾谋面的伙伴息息相关，他们就是人类的五种主要情绪：乐乐、忧忧、怕怕、厌厌和怒怒&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116731120981032&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/b6573105a6cebd2fa25ec1a992cf9c3cdbe06441.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1U5Eq6AELx</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1U5Eq6AELx</guid><pubDate>Fri, 12 Jun 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>作为老二，它总是被忽略！可如今看这部上世纪的动画却能发现平庸中的精彩</title><description>《玩具总动员2》小主人参加夏令营去了，伍迪因为破旧而没被带去。留在家里的伍迪恰巧被一个玩具收藏家发现了，认为他是近代最具代表性的玩具。于是将伍迪被偷了出来放在颇富盛名的文化博物馆内展览&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116718991055683&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/31e0cea56cb5ab880b05fd333ca251cfd4a5e297.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15SEE64E5q</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15SEE64E5q</guid><pubDate>Tue, 09 Jun 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>上世纪的3D动画现在依然是经典！跟特效没关系，它能触达每个人的童年</title><description>《玩具总动员1》小主人家境富裕，拥有一屋的玩具。其中他最爱的是牛仔玩偶胡迪，胡迪因此成为众玩具的“老大”。当小主人出门在外时，一屋的玩具自成世界，过着自己的生活。一天，小主人带回了一个新的玩意：太空战警巴斯光年。巴斯光年长相新奇，功能先进，令小主人爱不释手，威胁到了胡迪的地位.....&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116703354688601&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/35de62791d926fcdca989048da9edc4036f1283d.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vuEn6aEZv</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vuEn6aEZv</guid><pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>明明是女主，却拿了奥斯卡最佳女配？不得不感叹男主演技实在太变态了</title><description>《丹麦女孩》根据世界上首位变性人士生平改编！讲述一段跨越性别和性向的爱情，重现一位最早接受性别重置手术的丹麦画家与妻子的传奇故事。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116696459383898&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8f52e6566cd361a73fbfd6bb82be4acbf1e6e6ed.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1e47C6xE5k</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1e47C6xE5k</guid><pubDate>Fri, 05 Jun 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>玛雅预言轰动世界引起恐慌，灾难片的里程碑，时隔14年再看依然震撼</title><description>《2012》太阳活动异常，地球内部的能量平衡系统面临崩溃，玛雅人的预言即将实现，人类将遭遇灭顶之灾。各国政府已经联手开始秘密制造方舟，希望能躲过这一浩劫。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116663005483324&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/48af8662af877c57202b25c99a48e38f140e6a50.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VqV369Euu</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VqV369Euu</guid><pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>把老鼠放进帽子里，你也可以成为艺术家！时隔20年我重新看懂了它</title><description>《美食总动员》小老鼠雷米在嗅觉方面有着无与伦比的天赋，不想过与垃圾堆为伴的生活，心怀成为五星大厨的梦想。 一个偶然的机会，他认识了古斯特餐厅的学徒林奎尼...&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116673071814902&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/152dc580b1cecaff71269b093f5e2c4bd5c6c04b.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1E2Vd6xEK7</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1E2Vd6xEK7</guid><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jun 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>你的眼睛很像你妈！霍格沃兹保卫战拉开帷幕！跨越10年的收尾，让它成为最经典的系列电影</title><description>《哈利波特与死亡圣器下》当又一次和伏地魔的意识连通，哈利·波特断定最后一件魂器藏在霍格沃茨，于是和罗恩、赫敏一同返回阴云密布的学校。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116650774894350&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8c644ba25089d05dff7151b321d60c9a058e611c.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SQGX6hEMH</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SQGX6hEMH</guid><pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>当你的心理年龄超过父母，就能理解他们“犯下的错”！冷门宝藏电影</title><description>《遥远的街区》托马斯年过五十，一次机缘巧合之下，他回到了阔别已久的家乡，让他没有想到的是，自己竟然意外的穿越回了四十年前，衰老的灵魂回到了年轻的身躯之中，记忆深处似曾相识的回忆和景象如今一一展现在了托马斯眼前。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116622622791530&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7092aed86ed993a017d2134ca7883a6849f8ff1c.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1QZGi6pEJ3</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1QZGi6pEJ3</guid><pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>如果说高考是龙门，那么高三呢？拼命挣扎的一年也会成为美好回忆</title><description>《高三》善良严厉的班主任，紧张刻苦的尖子生，逃避生活的“差生”，执着爱情的“早恋生”，学生的父母，每个亲历高三的人都有各自的感悟和超越高三的期望。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116616834585805&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/606166d48ca94c46be87e27a781a2db7b4c7679a.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1D6Lv6dEyn</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1D6Lv6dEyn</guid><pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>日本太擅长拍这种电影了，27岁大外甥和6岁小姨也能如此治愈</title><description>《白兔糖》27岁的上班族河地大吉赶回家乡参加外公的葬礼，意外见到了外公的私生女——美丽而可怜的鹿贺凛。凛自然无法得到鹿贺家族的认可，却引起了大吉的关注与同情。最终，大吉将这个年仅6岁、尚在尿床的小阿姨带回东京独自抚养&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116599520501200&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/fc3fb84e0e48d97451b257385a725e584c8d62b6.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1q7LM6oEpW</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1q7LM6oEpW</guid><pubDate>Tue, 19 May 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item><item><title>死亡是生命终点站，那上一站是哪里？虚构的励志传记片依然打动人心</title><description>《最后一次赛跑》1956年澳大利亚墨尔本奥运会，年轻的德国人保罗•阿弗霍夫摘取了马拉松赛跑比赛的金牌。多年后，身处养老院的保罗•阿弗霍夫为了寻找生命的意义，再次参加了柏林马拉松比赛，可已经满头白发的他能否跑完全程.....&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116588028105871&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8bcc0be7e36da82d5d91b79de47963d4d6765510.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ELLJ6ZESb</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ELLJ6ZESb</guid><pubDate>Sun, 17 May 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>长片短解</author></item></channel></rss>